#: ../../technical/articles/105-profile-facts-registration-recovery-and-session-selection.md:32
msgid ""
"Profile pointer changes use a reentrant transaction associated with a "
"canonical storage root and a root lock. Compare-and-swap checks the "
"observed pointer before transition, and clear/restore operations advance "
"revisions rather than silently overwriting concurrent changes. Corrupt "
"pointer state is surfaced for manual recovery. The dedicated ports "
"separate pointer policy from persistence. profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
"profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
"profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
"profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Els canvis del punter de perfil utilitzen una transacció reentrant "
"associada a una arrel canònica d'emmagatzematge i un bloqueig d'arrel. La"
" comparació i intercanvi comprova el punter observat abans de la "
"transició, i les operacions de neteja i restauració avancen revisions en "
"lloc de sobreescriure silenciosament canvis concurrents. L'estat corrupte"
" del punter es mostra per a recuperació manual. Els ports dedicats "
"separen la política del punter de la persistència. profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
"profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
"profile_pointer.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/profile_pointer.py`) "
